        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Stalone e Aninha agora vivem confortavelmente num hotel decadente no Uruguai, sem sinais de Márcio. Stalone jura que o hotel é uma herança de sua mãe e convida os novos moradores do Instituto Santa Lúcia para uma temporada na propriedade, o que demanda mais uma aventura emocionante na estrada.",
          "runtime": 85,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "RU",
        "iso_639_1": "ru",
        "name": "Pусский",
        "english_name": "Russian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Когда владелец отеля в Уругвае умирает, Сталлоне (человек с синдромом Дауна) решает, что именно он — законный наследник, игнорируя Худыша (аутиста), приёмного сына покойного. Сталлоне собирает друзей из своего бывшего интерната, и вместе с ними отправляется в рискованное путешествие на грузовом самолёте. Внезапно их пути пересекаются с контрабандистами, охотящимися за драгоценностями.",
          "runtime": 86,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Приятели и наследник"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Following the death of a hotelier in Punta del Este, Uruguay, an unexpected inheritance dispute begins. Stallone, an actor with Down syndrome, believes he is the rightful heir to the hotel. On the other side is Magrelo, a young autistic man who was raised as an adopted son by the deceased. Without waiting for the reading of the will, Stallone decides to reunite his old friends with Down syndrome from the institute where they lived in Brazil to spend a week's vacation at the hotel.",
          "runtime": 86,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Buddies and the Heir"
        }
      }
    ]
